    <main id="main-content" class="main-content">
        <div class="content-container"> <article class="calculator-page-content"> <h1 class="page-title">Tip Calculator</h1>

                <section class="calculator-description-section content-section">
                    <p>Tipping and splitting the bill shouldn't be a headache. Our <strong>Free Tip Calculator</strong> makes it simple. Instantly find the right gratuity, see your final bill, and divide the cost evenly among any number of people. Perfect for restaurants, bars, delivery, and more – get accurate results in seconds.</p>
                </section>

                <section id="calculator-section" class="calculator-interface content-section card"> 
                    <h2 class="section-title">Calculate Your Tip & Bill</h2>                    
                    <div id="errorMessages" class="error-messages" style="display:none;"></div>
                    <form id="calculatorForm" class="calculator-form">
                        <fieldset>
                            <legend>Bill & Tip Details</legend>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="billAmount">Bill Amount ($):</label>
                                <input type="number" id="billAmount" placeholder="55.75" required step="0.01" min="0" aria-describedby="billAmountHelp">
                                <small id="billAmountHelp" class="form-text text-muted">Enter the cost of your bill before adding tax or tip.</small>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="tipPercentage">Tip Percentage (%):</label>
                                <input type="number" id="tipPercentage" placeholder="18" required step="1" min="0" aria-describedby="tipPercentageHelp">
                                <small id="tipPercentageHelp" class="form-text text-muted">Enter your desired tip percentage, or use a quick button.</small>
                            </div>
                             <div class="form-group quick-tip-buttons">
                                <label>Quick Tip %:</label>
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-tip="15">15%</button>
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-tip="18">18%</button>
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-tip="20">20%</button>
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-tip="25">25%</button>
                            </div>
                        </fieldset>
                         <fieldset>
                            <legend>Split the Bill</legend>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="numPeople">Number of People:</label>
                                <input type="number" id="numPeople" value="1" placeholder="1" required step="1" min="1" aria-describedby="numPeopleHelp">
                                 <small id="numPeopleHelp" class="form-text text-muted">Enter how many people are splitting the total bill (including tip).</small>
                            </div>
                        </fieldset>
                        <div class="form-actions">
                            <button type="button" id="calculateButton" class="btn btn-primary">Calculate</button>
                            <button type="reset" id="resetButton" class="btn btn-secondary">Reset</button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                    <div id="resultsSection" class="results-section" style="display:none;">
                        <h3 class="results-title">Your Results</h3>
                        <div class="results-grid">
                            <div class="result-item card"> <h4>Tip Amount</h4> <p id="tipAmountResult">--</p> </div>
                            <div class="result-item card"> <h4>Total Bill</h4> <p id="totalBillResult">--</p> </div>
                            <div class="result-item card" id="perPersonSection" style="display:none;"> <h4>Amount Per Person</h4> <p id="perPersonResult">--</p> </div>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                </section>

                <section class="how-to-use-section content-section">
                    <h2 class="section-title">How to Use This Calculator</h2>
                    <ol>
                        <li><strong>Enter Bill Amount:</strong> Input the subtotal from your check into the 'Bill Amount' field.</li>
                        <li><strong>Choose Tip %:</strong> Select a standard rate (15%, 18%, 20%, 25%) using the quick buttons or enter a custom percentage.</li>
                        <li><strong>Add People:</strong> Enter the number of people sharing the bill (e.g., '3'). Leave as '1' if not splitting.</li>
                        <li><strong>Get Results:</strong> Click 'Calculate' to instantly see the Tip Amount, Total Bill, and the Per-Person Cost (if splitting).</li>
                    </ol>
                </section>

                <section class="content-section">
                    <h2 class="section-title">Understanding Tipping Etiquette</h2>
                    <p>Tipping is a common practice in many countries, especially the United States, as a way to show appreciation for good service. However, customs and expected amounts can vary significantly based on the service type and location.</p>
                    <h2>Why is Tipping Customary?</h2> <p>In many service industries, particularly in the US, employees' base wages are often set lower with the expectation that tips will supplement their income. Tipping allows customers to directly reward attentive, efficient, and friendly service.</p>
                    <h2>Standard Tipping Rates (USA)</h2> <p>While amounts can vary, here are some generally accepted guidelines (always based on pre-tax amounts):</p>
                    <ul> <li><strong>Restaurants (Sit-down):</strong> 15-20% for good service, 20%+ for excellent service.</li> <li><strong>Bars:</strong> 15-20% of the bill, or $1-$2 per drink.</li> <li><strong>Food/Grocery Delivery:</strong> 15-20%.</li> <li><strong>Hairdressers/Barbers:</strong> 15-20%.</li> <li><strong>Taxis/Rideshares:</strong> 10-20%.</li> <li><strong>Takeout:</strong> Optional, but 10-15% is a nice gesture, especially for large orders.</li> </ul>
                    <h2>Tip Before or After Tax?</h2> <p>The generally accepted etiquette is to calculate the tip amount based on the <strong>pre-tax</strong> subtotal of your bill. Our calculator uses the amount you enter (assumed to be pre-tax) for the calculation.</p>
                    <h2>How Our Calculator Works: The Formula</h2> <p>Our calculator uses these simple formulas:</p>
                    <ul> <li><code>Tip Amount = Bill Amount * (Tip Percentage / 100)</code></li> <li><code>Total Bill = Bill Amount + Tip Amount</code></li> <li><code>Amount Per Person = Total Bill / Number of People</code></li> </ul>
                </section>
                
